# Every output of this DUT is legitimately X: the whole point of the test is a
# function LOCAL that is read before it is ever written, whose value at call
# entry is undefined (an `automatic` variable has none), so `result` and
# `fflags` are X by construction.  A value-comparing Verilator co-sim therefore
# has nothing to compare and reports a divergence on every cycle.
#
# The real gate is test_structural.ys: without the fix the reader seeds the
# local from its own wire and `check` finds one logic loop per bit (32 here, 32
# in RSD FPExecutionStage where read_slang finds 0); with it, `check -assert`
# passes.
SKIP_SIM_EQUIV=1
